<title>USA: Balchem's Weiss to retire as president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Balchem's Weiss to retire as president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SLATE HILL, N.Y. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Balchem Corp said Monday that Herb Weiss, president and chief executive officer, will retire on December 31 and will be succeeded by Ray Reber.</p>
<p>The company did not specify Reber's present title but said he was in charge of Balchem's operations.</p>
<p>Weiss has recommended that Reber join the company's board, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
